[?2004l[?2004h>         molecule_pool_filepath: Path to PDF file containing list of chemicals
[?2004l[?2004h>         top_k: Number of top similar molecules to return
[?2004l[?2004h>     
[?2004l[?2004h>     Returns:
[?2004l[?2004h>         List of chemical names sorted by Tanimoto similarity (descending),
[?2004l[?2004h>         with alphabetical ordering for ties.
